# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Romance of the Three Kingdoms (三国演义): characters and relationships on a timeline.

Chapter numbers (回) follow the 120-chapter Mao Zonggang text.

Node fields
  lane:   overview swimlane: qun (Han court and warlords) / wei / shu / wu
  debut:  chapter in which the character first appears on stage
  dies:   chapter in which the character dies (or in which the death is first reported), or None
  camps:  [(chapter, camp), ...]  allegiance from the END of that chapter on.
          camp: han / qun / wei / shu / wu / jin
  py:     pinyin
Edge fields
  phases: [(chapter, type, zh label, zh text, en label, en text, ref)], in order. The edge appears at the
          first phase's chapter; from each phase's chapter on, that phase's type and label apply.
          ref is the chapter(s) cited: an int, a (first, last) range, or a list of those; None = the phase chapter.
"""

