    bio=("本是陈留王，董卓废了少帝，立他为帝(第4回)，又挟他西迁长安。李傕、郭汜作乱后，曹操把他迎到许都(第14回)，从此“挟天子以令诸侯”。他认刘备为皇叔，咬破手指写下衣带诏，命董承等人除掉曹操(第20回)；事情败露，董承等被杀(第24回)，伏皇后也被乱棒打死(第66回)。第八十回曹丕逼他禅位，他被封为山阳公，离开了许都。",
         "Once the Prince of Chenliu, he is put on the throne when Dong Zhuo deposes his brother (ch. 4), and dragged west to Chang’an. After the chaos of Li Jue and Guo Si, Cao Cao brings him to Xu (ch. 14) and from then on “holds the emperor to command the lords”. He recognizes Liu Bei as an imperial uncle and writes a secret edict in his own blood, sewn into a belt, ordering Dong Cheng and others to destroy Cao Cao (ch. 20); the plot is discovered and the conspirators killed (ch. 24), and later Empress Fu is beaten to death (ch. 66). In chapter 80 Cao Pi forces him to abdicate and makes him Duke of Shanyang."),
