    bio=("巨鹿郡人，本是不第秀才，入山采药时遇到南华老仙，得了《太平要术》，能呼风唤雨。他自称“天公将军”，喊出“苍天已死，黄天当立”，四方头裹黄巾的信徒起兵响应(第1回)。刘关张、曹操、孙坚都在讨伐黄巾时初露头角；到第二回，张角已经死了，黄巾很快被平定。",
         "A failed examination candidate from Julu who met an old immortal while gathering herbs and received a book of magic that let him summon wind and rain. Calling himself Lord General of Heaven, he proclaims that “the blue sky is dead, the yellow sky shall rise”, and followers wearing yellow turbans rise across the land (ch. 1). Liu Bei, Guan Yu, Zhang Fei, Cao Cao and Sun Jian all first make their names fighting the Yellow Turbans; by chapter 2 Zhang Jue is dead, and the rising is soon crushed."),
