    bio=("陇西临洮人，起初讨黄巾兵败，被刘关张救下，却因三人是“白身”而十分轻慢(第1回)。他带西凉兵进京，废少帝、立献帝(第4回)，在洛阳肆意杀掠，又焚烧宫室、迁都长安(第6回)。他收吕布为义子，王允用貂蝉施连环计离间二人(第8回)，第九回董卓被吕布刺死，守尸的军士在他肥胖的尸体肚脐上点火为灯。",
         "A general from Longxi who, routed by the Yellow Turbans, is rescued by Liu Bei and his brothers, then sneers at them for holding no rank (ch. 1). He marches his Xiliang troops into the capital, deposes the young emperor and enthrones Emperor Xian (ch. 4), kills and loots freely, then burns Luoyang and moves the court to Chang’an (ch. 6). He adopts Lü Bu as his son; Wang Yun sets them against each other with Diaochan (ch. 8), and in chapter 9 Lü Bu kills him. Guards set his fat corpse’s navel alight as a lamp."),
