    sub=("南蛮王", "King of the Southern Man"),
    bio=("南中的蛮王，趁刘备新丧起兵。诸葛亮采纳马谡“攻心为上”之策，七擒七纵(第87至90回)：他借兵、诈降、请来驱使猛兽的木鹿大王和刀枪不入的藤甲兵，屡败屡起。到第七次被擒，他垂泪说：“丞相天威，南人不复反矣！”从此南方安定。",
         "King of the southern tribes, who rises in revolt soon after Liu Bei’s death. Following Ma Su’s advice to “win the heart, not the city”, Zhuge Liang captures and releases him seven times (ch. 87–90): he borrows armies, feigns surrender, calls in King Mulu with his wild beasts and the rattan-armored troops whom no blade can pierce, and rises after every defeat. Taken the seventh time, he weeps: “By your heavenly might, Chancellor, the southerners will never rebel again.” The south is at peace from then on."),
