    P(42, "kin", "掷子于地", "赵云从长坂坡救回阿斗，刘备接过来掷在地上：“为汝这孺子，几损我一员大将！”",
      "Thrown down", "When Zhao Yun brings A Dou out of Changban, Liu Bei throws the baby to the ground: “For you, little brat, I nearly lost a great general!”"),
